No existing symlink tests. The fix: canonicalize paths via symlink resolution in `Open` and `CreateLedger` so both real and symlinked paths map to the same registry entry and same on-disk path.

Design:

Add helper in ledger.go:

```go
// canonicalLedgerPath 将路径解析为账本的规范路径：解析目录（及文件本身）
// 中的符号链接，使同一账本经不同路径（如目录软链接）打开时共享同一注册表项。
// 文件不存在时（尚未初始化）解析其父目录；父目录也无法解析时退回原路径。
func canonicalLedgerPath(abs string) string {
	if resolved, err := filepath.EvalSymlinks(abs); err == nil {
		return resolved
	}
	if resolved, err := filepath.EvalSymlinks(filepath.Dir(abs)); err == nil {
		return filepath.Join(resolved, filepath.Base(abs))
	}
	return abs
}
